{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“还不知下次能否坦白”理解成“不确定对方是否能接受坦白”，改变了不确定性的主体。原稿表达的是他自己还不知道下次能不能开口，而不是怀疑对方能不能接受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"没有拼错主要处境和原因，但把原稿中气味、身体、幻想、遗憾与快感交织、舒服得失去方向的感官体验，概括成了一般的依恋和期待，感受层次有所遗漏。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"没有拼错互相需要、互相依靠的关系判断，但漏掉了原稿非常突出的情欲暖意、执念，以及明知被卷入仍不想退出的复杂感受，弱化了这一屏的情感强度。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"处境和原因基本正确，但感受概括得偏一般。原稿这一屏突出的是明亮轻盈、身体恢复弹性、带着玩心和调情意味的主动回应，不只是勇敢、甜蜜和憧憬。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲主线与完整稿是同一件事：他从害怕自己的喜欢成为负担，到逐渐相信彼此可能互相需要，再经历对失去的恐惧，最终不再索要永远不变的保证，也不再隐藏喜欢，选择坦然珍惜并继续陪伴。观众主要弱化了部分情欲、感官体验和音乐情绪的细腻层次，但没有改变故事的核心关系、发展方向和结局。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0d3b1116-30bc-47fa-99f2-9d0157c53a61", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T025828763936Z", "elapsed_seconds": 160.766, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T03:01:09.534083+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d6bcb68103a2c1a919c17b0c07bf6dfad7efc73aba57864ee4e449ef5abf2d41", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T025828763936Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a0ee9e2286e87c56803da54a8aa02443dbacf4feab2168b4e0137410153912d3"}}}
